{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>路透引述消息報道，Nvidia前行政總裁黃仁勳曾與第二名員工有親密關係。路透未披露第二名員工的姓名。早前傳出的出軌對象包括Alice Huang（黃樂）及Nvidia醫療保健業務副總裁鮑威爾（Kimberly Powell）。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T01:23:55.822418+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T00:15:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T20:21:08.024612+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T01:17:26.202894+00:00","content_hash":"e916fcb1c62239aef548e388383181e04faadaf61336a70e2797f43e81d079e6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}